     {{ 'secretpassword' | password_hash('sha256', 'mysecretsalt', rounds=10000) }}
     # => "$5$rounds=10000$mysecretsalt$Tkm80llAxD4YHll6AgNIztKn0vzAACsuuEfYeGP7tm7"
 
+For BCrypt, use ``ident`` to select the hash variant. It can be combined with ``salt`` and ``rounds``::
+
+    {{ 'secretpassword' | password_hash('blowfish', ident='2y') }}
+    # => "$2y$..."
+
